    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-040">Retire the Action as catalog data (BA editor / Dataverse MCP), mirror-first. Do NOT delete the Action by editing code that assumes catalog contents; the catalog is the source of truth for Action rows.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Remove ONLY the ChannelActionCode const (DailyBriefingNarrator.cs:62) and any residual reference to it. Do NOT touch TldrActionCode (line 61) or the BRIEF-NARRATE-TLDR resolution/call — that leg stays.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">A repo-wide grep -r "BRIEF-NARRATE-CHANNEL" src/ MUST return zero hits at task completion. Catalog exports, migration notes, or docs may retain the string for provenance (note this), but no code path may reference it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Update eval cases in golden-utterances.json / GoldenUtteranceEvalSuiteTests.cs that reference the channel Action so the eval suite stays green after retirement (NFR-05 / NFR-02).</constraint>
    <constraint source="root-CLAUDE.md-§10">BFF-touching task: state placement decision, run dotnet publish, report compressed size + diff vs 49.63 MB baseline, confirm no new HIGH CVE.</constraint>
  </constraints>

